<title>USA: Aerovox Chairman Tuttle retires as CEO.</title>
<headline>Aerovox Chairman Tuttle retires as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH DARTMOUTH, Mass. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerovox Inc said on Tuesday Clifford Tuttle retired as chief executive but will continue as chairman of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Robert Elliott will succeed Tuttle as chief executive. He also will continue to serve as president and chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
<p>Tuttle joined Aerovox in 1970 as vice president of marketing and became president of the company in 1973, Aerovox said.</p>
</text>
